# lib/

Riffle library root. Houses the five architectural layers: Predicate engine, Ctx waist, Sia orchestrator, Service I/O boundary, and Cli thin coordinators. The application supervisor caches predicate evaluation.

## Dirs

- `riffle/` -- Five-layer architecture: Predicate engine, Ctx pure state, Sia pattern orchestration, Service I/O boundary, Cli coordinators
- `mix/` -- Mix task implementations for integration and tooling

## Files

- `riffle.ex` -- Main module; entry point and architectural overview
